WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.083
Nghenisa xikhomelo laha u lavaka layini ya wena yi sungula kona kutani u yimisa nenge wun'we etlhelweni ka xona.

00:00:08.083 --> 00:00:17.833
Rhurhisa nenge lowun'wana u wu tlhandlukisa kumbe u wu rhelelisa ku kondza ntambhu yi hayeka ehenhla ka mfungho wa ku ringanana.

00:00:17.833 --> 00:00:20.667
Funga ndhawu yoleyo hi xikhomelo.

00:00:20.667 --> 00:00:31.208
Hlayisa nenge wolowo wu nga fambi, rhendzelekisa nenge wo sungula wu ya etlhelweni lerin'wana, kuma ku ringanana nakambe kutani u funga hi xikhomelo.

00:00:31.208 --> 00:00:43.458
Ya emahlweni u tsemakanya ndhawu yo rhelela.

00:00:43.458 --> 00:00:52.125
Layini leyi nga voniwiki leyi tsemakanyaka ndhawu yo rhelela leyi hlanganisaka tindhawu leti nga eka ku leha loku fanaka.
